                                <p>Decentralized ID (DID), Blockchain, NFTs, IoT, AI</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="pawqeris-info-item pawqeris-right-item">
                                <h6>Delivered by</h6>
                                <p>Clarisco Solutions</p>
