                                            , "Faster, safer adoptions and ownership transfers."
                                            , "Fewer missed vaccines and appointments."
                                            , "Stronger engagement through community, learning, and shopping."
                                            , "More visible, accountable support for shelters and pet health research."
                                            , "New revenue routes for vendors, providers, and sponsors." ]; %>

                                            <section class="pawqeris-results py-5 ">
                                                <div class="container">

